# 1. docker compose up -d
# 2. F5 (both projects start)

@api = https://localhost:7138

### Lend a book
POST {{api}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patronId": 6,
  "bookId": 5
}

### Send it again - 409, the patron already has it
POST {{api}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patronId": 6,
  "bookId": 5
}

### Fetch a loan
GET {{api}}/api/loans/31
